{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"Y\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big选Y：Y的大块直接交代人物、原因和动作，单看大字更容易理解每屏发生了什么，并串起情节；X的放大词虽然醒目，但不少只是从完整句子中摘出的情绪片段。small选X、core选X：X的小字更常补充具体体验，并与人物当下的心理变化紧密相连，整体持续扣住亲密的幸福与害怕失去之间的纠缠；Y的“情欲执念”“情色暖意”等有些偏离核心。concise选Y：X存在比较明确的重复，例如大字“握得更紧”与小字再次描述握紧，以及“有点想哭”与“眼泪终于不用憋着”；human选X：Y有“怕太急弄坏自在他还是收住”“气味身体幻想遗憾快感交融”等搭配生硬、名词堆叠的问题。fine选X：X的“还没有失去什么，就已经舍不得”“白天和某个人相处得很好，独处时心头却泛酸”等体验更具体、有辨识度；load选X：X虽然大字片段略多，但每块较短、意群清楚，Y的大字块整体较长，部分一块容纳多个动作，扫读负担相对更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "25ffacf2-c67b-4842-bcad-48eefcbb6690", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T183816802470Z", "elapsed_seconds": 303.125, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T18:43:19.937812+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0f44bbaf0478342b2761af47396db081d133c1fb369fdee4237ad381f398d27b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d98